---
layout: layouts/enterprise.njk
navActive: services
title: "Cybersecurity Services | VAPT, Penetration Testing, Cloud & API Security | CipherTrivia"
description: "Explore CipherTrivia's full cybersecurity service catalog: VAPT, penetration testing, web, mobile, API and cloud security, DevSecOps, SOC as a Service and compliance."
crumbs: [["Home", "/"], ["Services"]]
pageSchema: false
---
{% from "partials/enterprise/macros.njk" import arrow %}
{% from "partials/enterprise/icons.njk" import icon %}
{#- Groups follow the header menu. Copy per service: the homepage services section (description
    and tag line); AI Security from its own page. "assets" drives the "What are you securing?"
    filter: web, mobile, api, cloud, network, pipeline, ai, monitoring, compliance. -#}
{%- set groups = [
  { name: "Offensive Security", services: [
    { url: "/services/vapt-security-services/", icon: "target", name: "VAPT Security Services", assets: "web mobile api cloud network",
